# Dynamic Client Payroll, Wage Billing & Invoice Automation Engine

## System Overview & Architecture

This implementation establishes a production-grade, enterprise-ready **Payroll-to-Invoice Automation Engine** for JOY PeopleHR / JOY Corporate Solutions. 

The architecture completely decouples client-specific billing requirements from hardcoded application logic by introducing a **dynamic, configuration-driven rule engine** with effective-dated policies, immutable financial snapshots, employee-level audit drill-downs, statutory reconciliation, and multi-format Excel/PDF generation.

