### 2. Core Calculation & Engine Services
#### [NEW] [clientBillingEngine.ts](file:///d:/Joy%20PeopleHR%20new%20version/workforceos-enterprise-hrms/src/services/clientBilling/clientBillingEngine.ts)
- Pure, deterministic calculation pipeline implementing Steps 1 through 10.
- Dynamic wage determination supporting Monthly, Daily Wage, Hourly, Shift Rate, Piece Rate, and Fixed Contract wages.
- Dynamic payable days engine respecting client salary divisor rules.
- Employer statutory cost calculation separating employee deduction from employer liability (EPF 3.67%, EPS 8.33%, EDLI 0.5%, EPF Admin 0.5%, Employer ESI 3.25%).
- Contractual billing charge calculation (Service Charges %, Transport per employee/day, Canteen recoveries, Uniform charges, Accommodations).
- Indian GST Engine evaluating supplier state vs. client state (Intrastate CGST+SGST vs. Interstate IGST).
- Human-readable calculation explainability tree generation.
- Configurable financial rounding engine (`ROUND`, `ROUND_UP`, `ROUND_DOWN`).

#### [NEW] [clientBillingRunService.ts](file:///d:/Joy%20PeopleHR%20new%20version/workforceos-enterprise-hrms/src/services/clientBilling/clientBillingRunService.ts)
- CRUD and lifecycle orchestration for Client Billing Runs.
- Attendance & Payroll data aggregation from active employees mapped to the contract.
- Pre-invoice validation guard (checks locked attendance, active contracts, tax config, and positive totals).
- Immutable snapshot creation (`payroll_snapshot`, `billing_snapshot`, `invoice_snapshot`) upon approval to guarantee historical reproducibility.
- Sequence-safe, configurable invoice numbering generator (e.g. `JCS/2026-27/001`).

#### [NEW] [clientMasterService.ts](file:///d:/Joy%20PeopleHR%20new%20version/workforceos-enterprise-hrms/src/services/clientBilling/clientMasterService.ts)
- Management of Clients, Contracts, Deployments, and Billing Policies with effective dating and multi-tenant isolation.
- Preloaded standard client profiles and contract templates (e.g. Heavy Engineering Manpower, Manufacturing Facility, IT Staffing, Security Services) serving as working dynamic configurations.

#### [NEW] [billingExportEngine.ts](file:///d:/Joy%20PeopleHR%20new%20version/workforceos-enterprise-hrms/src/services/clientBilling/billingExportEngine.ts)
- Multi-sheet Excel workbook generator:
  - **Sheet 1**: Detailed Employee-wise Wage Register (Sl No, UAN, ESI IP, Days, OT, Earnings, Deductions, Net, Employer PF/ESI).
  - **Sheet 2**: Salary & OT Workings.
  - **Sheet 3**: Billing Summary & Contractual Charges.
  - **Sheet 4**: Formal GST Tax Invoice.
  - **Sheet 5**: Statutory PF/ESI Reconciliation Statement.
- PDF generation support with Indian currency formatting and Amount in Words conversion (`rupeesInWords`).
- Legacy Template Mapping Engine to import/map custom client formats without code changes.

